 function that parametrizes the surface:\n\n$$\nr(u,v)=⟨u,\\,v,\\,(u+v)^{2}⟩\n$$\n\nTherefore, the third component of $r$ is $(u+v)^{2}.$\n\n**Note:** The parametrization is well-defined for $u$ and $v$ such that $u+v\\ge 0.$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362475 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362476 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362475 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362477 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362475 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362478 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362475 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362479 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362475 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362480 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362475 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362475 1077 "selection" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362475 1079 #edb/ref 17592186362480 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362475 1080 #uuid "50859c1e-f37e-52ce-84ca-b439c660573d" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362476 1081 "{u}^{2}+{v}^{2}" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362476 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362476 1084 #uuid "6831c1de-2d22-5f83-a124-3bff0cc917c7" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362477 1081 "\\sqrt{u+v}" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362477 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362477 1084 #uuid "593a18ab-3f63-54c6-b541-e09ad6470169" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362478 1081 "\\sqrt{u}+\\sqrt{v}" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362478 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362478 1084 #uuid "c9cc9fac-739c-5246-a226-7d78e70210ff" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362479 1081 "u+v" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362479 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362479 1084 #uuid "0f95f694-3fb7-5f4b-8a37-e75be6da3d8d" 13194139533445 