nt this system as the matrix differential equation ${x}^{′}(t)=Ax(t)$ as follows:\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}^{′} \\\\ {x}_{2}^{′}\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}0 & 1 \\\\ 5 & -3{e}^{2t}\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1} \\\\ {x}_{2}\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nHence, $A=[\\begin{aligned}0 & 1 \\\\ 5 & -3{e}^{2t}\\end{aligned}].$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362578 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362579 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362578 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362580 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362578 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362581 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362578 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362582 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362578 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362583 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362578 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362578 1077 "selection" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362578 1079 #edb/ref 17592186362583 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362578 1080 #uuid "f95a044b-34ca-52ac-bf5d-97e513fdc476" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362579 1081 "[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ 5 & -3{e}^{2t}\\end{aligned}]" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362579 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362579 1084 #uuid "8ae3f58e-cbd2-5425-9424-7688872fbd2f" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362580 1081 "[\\begin{aligned}0 & 1 \\\\ -3{e}^{2t} & 5\\end{aligned}]" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362580 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362580 1084 #uuid "98d231ae-2328-5e1a-9344-6341e0505b42" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362581 1081 "[\\begin{aligned}0 & 3{e}^{2t} \\\\ 5 & 0\\end{aligned}]" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362581 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362581 1084 #uuid "7968029c-b770-555d-9da8-434d8dca3b2e" 13194139533445 175921860