ces.\n\n- ${T}_{1}$ maps ${R}^{2}$ onto a line. Notice that the columns of ${T}_{1}$ are linearly dependent but it's not the zero matrix. So, $\\text{rank}({T}_{1})=1.$\n\n- ${T}_{2}$ maps ${R}^{2}$ onto $(0,0)$ since ${T}_{2}$ is the zero matrix, i.e. $\\text{rank}({T}_{2})=0.$\n\n- ${T}_{3}$ maps ${R}^{2}$ onto ${R}^{2}.$ Indeed, ${T}_{3}$ is a nonsingular matrix, i.e. $\\text{rank}({T}_{3})=2.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"${T}_{1}$ only.\"" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362632 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362633 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362632 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362634 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362632 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362635 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362632 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362636 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362632 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362637 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362632 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362632 1077 "selection" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362632 1079 #edb/ref 17592186362634 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362632 1080 #uuid "4d4cdb48-2c70-5c58-8179-52d11b0057e2" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362633 1081 "${T}_{2}$ only" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362633 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362633 1084 #uuid "6707aa95-7385-5666-ab9f-8e517cb70b8c" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362634 1081 "${T}_{1}$ only" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362634 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362634 1084 #uuid "e1b4b4fb-b2a1-5812-abfe-7f88606e3432" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362635 1081 "${T}_{3}$ only" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362635 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362635 1084 #uuid "6e6543ba-9d3b-5c31-8a43-6c7e29ccd78f" 13194139533445 17592186045585 tru