and ${M}_{ij}$ are the minimum and maximum values of $f$ in each subregion ${R}_{ij}.$ \n\nNow, since ${m}_{ij}={M}_{ij}=-8,$ we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L(f,P)=U(f,P) & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}(-8)\\,Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j} \\\\  & =-8({\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}Δ{x}_{i})({\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}Δ{y}_{j}) \\\\  & =-8(-1-(-2))(3-(-2)) \\\\  & =-8\\cdot 1\\cdot 5 \\\\  & =-40.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we obtain\n\n$$\nL(f,P)=-40\\le {∬}_{R}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}A\\le -40=U(f,P)\n$$\n\nwhich implies that\n\n$$\n{∬}_{R}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}A=-40.\n$$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362708 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362709 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362708 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362710 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362708 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362711 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362708 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362712 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362708 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362713 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362708 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362708 1077 "selection" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362708 1079 #edb/ref 17592186362709 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362708 1080 #uuid "bda71f08-4223-5390-ac86-8180b13a60a3" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362709 1081 "-40" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362709 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362709 1084 #uuid "4438e799-b734-54ba-8480-8ae60e0a3db5" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362710 1081 "-36" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362710 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362710 1084 #uuid "6620214c-e520-5e36-94fe-9ad0d359d891" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362711 1081 "-35" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362711 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362711 1084 #uuid "95d7abbd-c5d2