alues of $f$ in each subregion ${R}_{ij}.$ \n\nNow, since ${m}_{ij}={M}_{ij}=-1,$ we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L(f,P)=U(f,P) & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}(-1)\\,Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j} \\\\  & =-1({\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}Δ{x}_{i})({\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}Δ{y}_{j}) \\\\  & =-1(2-(-2))(10-8) \\\\  & =-1\\cdot 4\\cdot 2 \\\\  & =-8.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we obtain\n\n$$\nL(f,P)=-8\\le {∬}_{R}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}A\\le -8=U(f,P)\n$$\n\nwhich implies that\n\n$$\n{∬}_{R}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}A=-8.\n$$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362715 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362716 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362715 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362717 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362715 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362718 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362715 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362719 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362715 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362720 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362715 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362715 1077 "selection" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362715 1079 #edb/ref 17592186362716 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362715 1080 #uuid "9c303871-2c67-599d-b4b9-385476d8014c" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362716 1081 "-8" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362716 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362716 1084 #uuid "6e859b87-d2ed-5097-829c-da7b2c3a61a7" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362717 1081 "8" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362717 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362717 1084 #uuid "228d4188-00cc-54b2-a34d-a83c20d9f4b6" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362718 1081 "-4" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362718 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362718 1084 #uuid "8e506a4c-cb9f-5948-8126-6aaac9df271e" 13194139533445 17592186045585 