 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362922 1071 "${\\sum }_{i=1}^{2}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{2}({i}^{2}+{j}^{2})=$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362922 1072 #uuid "671f8375-0214-529e-a001-961fce6318c2" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362922 1074 "First, we write out the inner summation by summing over the index $j:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\sum }_{i=1}^{2}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{2}({i}^{2}+{j}^{2}) & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{2}[{\\sum }_{j=1}^{2}({i}^{2}+{j}^{2})] \\\\  & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{2}[({i}^{2}+{1}^{2})+({i}^{2}+{2}^{2})] \\\\  & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{2}(2{i}^{2}+5)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we sum over the index $i:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\sum }_{i=1}^{2}(2{i}^{2}+5) & =[2(1)^{2}+5]+[2(2)^{2}+5] \\\\  & =7+13 \\\\  & =20\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362923 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362924 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362923 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362925 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362923 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362926 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362923 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362927 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362923 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362928 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362923 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362923 1077 "selection" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362923 1079 #edb/ref 17592186362924 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362923 1080 #uuid "90cee4e0-9976-5c17-bd79-033355be91a5" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362924 1081 "20" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362924 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362924 1084 #uuid "bec402ac-cfcc-5f12-8bc1-3d6fb7bdcf1b" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362925 1081 "22" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362925 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362925 1084 #uuid "21968e98-3bc1-5f83-ad71-8d77e7a68648" 1