86045585 true] [17592186362943 1072 #uuid "50f28902-c131-5862-a511-9c9ad13508fc" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362943 1074 "The product rule for double summations states that\n\n$$\n{\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}{a}_{i}{b}_{j}={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{a}_{i}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}{b}_{j}.\n$$\n\nSo, using the product rule for double summations, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\sum }_{i=1}^{10}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{13}({a}_{i}-2)({b}_{j}-5) & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{10}({a}_{i}-2){\\sum }_{j=1}^{13}({b}_{j}-5).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, using the rules for single summations, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\sum }_{i=1}^{10}({a}_{i}-2){\\sum }_{j=1}^{13}({b}_{j}-5) & =({\\sum }_{i=1}^{10}{a}_{i}-{\\sum }_{i=1}^{10}2)\\cdot ({\\sum }_{j=1}^{13}{b}_{j}-{\\sum }_{j=1}^{13}5) \\\\  & =({\\sum }_{i=1}^{10}{a}_{i}-2{\\sum }_{i=1}^{10}1)\\cdot ({\\sum }_{j=1}^{13}{b}_{j}-5{\\sum }_{j=1}^{13}1) \\\\  & =(35-2\\cdot 10)\\cdot (70-5\\cdot 13) \\\\  & =(35-20)\\cdot (70-65) \\\\  & =(15)\\cdot (5) \\\\  & =75.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362944 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362945 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362944 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362946 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362944 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362947 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362944 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362948 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362944 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362949 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362944 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362944 1077 "selection" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362944 1079 #edb/ref 17592186362949 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362944 1080 #uuid "b944858b-8baa-5d16-beac-cfb6cb20defd" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362945 1081 "70" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362945 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362945 1084 #uuid "739f02b8-1a50-51f3-b599