 [17592186363375 1074 "In this case, we have an indeterminate form of type $\\frac{\\infty }{\\infty },$ so applying  L'Hopital's rule yields\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{x\\to \\infty }\\frac{2\\sqrt{x}+9x-1}{3x+5} & ={lim}_{x\\to \\infty }\\frac{[2\\sqrt{x}+9x-1]^{′}}{[3x+5]^{′}} \\\\  & ={lim}_{x\\to \\infty }\\frac{(\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{x}}+9)}{3} \\\\  & =\\frac{0+9}{3} \\\\  & =3.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363376 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363377 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363376 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045492 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363376 1077 "field-1" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363376 1079 #edb/ref 17592186363377 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363376 1080 #uuid "df1688f5-1632-58d6-9cc4-083bf852dbd5" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363377 1081 "3" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363377 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363377 1084 #uuid "05a44479-bf5c-5b14-9d18-27716a2a3d38" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363378 1068 #edb/ref 17592186363379 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363378 1069 "q-315831" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363378 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363378 1071 "What is ${\\int }_{2}^{8}\\operatorname{ln}⁡(5x+1)\\,\\text{d}x$ expressed as the limit of a right Riemann sum?\n\n*Hint: Write down the missing expression in terms of $m$ and $n.$*\n\n${\\int }_{2}^{8}\\operatorname{ln}⁡(5x+1)\\,\\text{d}x={lim}_{n\\to \\infty }{\\sum }_{m=1}^{n}[\\operatorname{ln}⁡($\n{{field-1}}$)\\cdot \\frac{6}{n}]$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363378 1072 #uuid "ac716160-cd13-516f-8618-dcec93b16168" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363378 1074 "The definite integral can be defined in terms of the limit of a right Riemann sum as\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{a}^{b}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x={lim}_{n\\to \\infty }{\\sum }_{m=1}^{n}f({x}_{m})\\cdot Δx,\n$$\n\nwhere ${x}_{m}=a+mΔx$ and $Δx=\\frac{b-a}{n}.$\n\nIn the definite integral\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{2}^{8}\\operatorname{ln}⁡(5x+1)\\,\\text{d}x,\n$$\n\nthe function is $f(x)=\\operatorname{ln}⁡(5x+1),$ the lower bound is $a=2$ and the upper bound is $b=8.$ So, we have\n\n$$\nΔx=\\frac{8-2}{n}=\\frac{6}{n}.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{2}^{8}\\operatorname{ln}⁡(5x+1)\\,\\text{d}x & ={lim}_{n\\to \\infty }{\\sum }_{m=1}^{n}f({x}_{m})\\cdot Δx \\\\  & ={lim}_{n\\to \\infty }{\\sum }_{m=1}^{n}[f(2+m\\cdot \\frac{6}{n})\\cdot \\frac{6}{n}] \\\\  & ={lim}_{n\\to \\infty }{\\sum }_{m=1}^{n}[f(2+\\frac{6m}{n})\\cdot \\frac{6}{n}] \\\\  & ={lim}_{n\\to \\infty }{\\sum }_{m=1}^{n}[\\operatorname{ln}⁡(5(2+\\frac{6m}{n})+1)\\cdot \\frac{6}{n}] \\\\  & ={lim}_{n\\to \\infty }{\\sum }_{m=1}^{n}[\\operatorname{ln}⁡(11+\\frac{30m}{n})\\cdot \\frac{6}{n}].\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363379 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363380 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363379 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045492 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363379 1077 "field-1" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363379 1079 #edb/ref 17592186363380 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363379 1080 #uuid "07649995-d867-534f-9e43-6b83134b223f" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363380 1081 "11+\\frac{30m}{n}" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363380 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363380 1084 #uuid "0bce27b2-5df3-5a8e-869e-d080b7d5082b" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363381 1068 #edb/ref 17592186363382 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363381 1068 #edb/ref 17592186363384 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363381 1069 "q-326016" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363381 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363381 1071 "![](images/0f/0f9ee37fe5f1cf