boarder at time $t$ is $v(t)={t}^{3}-3{t}^{2}-6t+8.$\n\nTo find the time interval in which the skateboarder is moving to the *left*, we must solve the inequality $v<0.$ This gives\n\n$$\n{t}^{3}-3{t}^{2}-6t+8=(t-1)({t}^{2}-2t-8)<0.\n$$\n\nPlotting the graph of $v(t)$, we get the following picture.\n\n![](images/c8/c86cdd70316b0bdb620a9a3224823be70069328e0aac83d2c0add2b925323423.png)\n\nFrom the graph, we see that $v<0$ whenever $1\\,<\\,t\\,<\\,4.$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363779 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363780 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363779 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045492 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363779 1077 "field-1" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363779 1079 #edb/ref 17592186363780 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363779 1080 #uuid "4d7f2738-e98b-54aa-b2eb-8252980bd9ed" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363780 1081 "1" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363780 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363780 1084 #uuid "7efbe3ba-518d-501d-8539-f183c63ae5d7" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363781 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363782 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363781 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045492 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363781 1077 "field-2" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363781 1079 #edb/ref 17592186363782 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363781 1080 #uuid "c605d975-c6f4-5fc8-a749-a990b683fadc" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363782 1081 "4" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363782 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363782 1084 #uuid "d06df830-42fd-5904-9966-2a1ce30c5f03" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363783 1068 #edb/ref 17592186363784 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363783 1069 "q-354836" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363783 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045486 1319