on of the line is:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r(t) & =a+tb \\\\ r(t) & =⟨-2,1,0⟩+t⟨5,-1,-3⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally then, ${a}_{1}+{a}_{2}=-2+1=-1,$ and $b=⟨5,-1,-3⟩.$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364020 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364021 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364020 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364022 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364020 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364023 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364020 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364024 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364020 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364025 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364020 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364020 1077 "selection" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364020 1079 #edb/ref 17592186364025 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364020 1080 #uuid "fe204930-21f0-5f11-87d8-144b4ea013e0" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364021 1081 "{a}_{1}+{a}_{2}=-2,\\,b=⟨5,-1,3⟩" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364021 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364021 1084 #uuid "3221a9ad-33cd-5589-8d04-58da9238940e" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364022 1081 "{a}_{1}+{a}_{2}=0,\\,b=⟨3,-1,-5⟩" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364022 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364022 1084 #uuid "c700d7ec-2dc4-5c91-b31f-02251699ee00" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364023 1081 "{a}_{1}+{a}_{2}=2,\\,b=⟨5,1,3⟩" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364023 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364023 1084 #uuid "50edec43-8dae-5c9f-ab3b-07f67a03c9d5" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364024 1081 "{a}_{1}+{a}_{2}=1,\\,b=⟨5,1,-3⟩" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364024 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364024 1084 #uuid "0fe78330-aad4-5b51-9fc7-f31f9d446