f3d6ef-59b8-5118-9c74-7e599c72085f" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364054 1074 "First, we write out the inner summation by summing over the index $i:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{2}{\\sum }_{i=1}^{2}{2}^{i}{3}^{j} & ={\\sum }_{j=1}^{2}[{\\sum }_{i=1}^{2}{2}^{i}{3}^{j}] \\\\  & ={\\sum }_{j=1}^{2}({2}^{1}{3}^{j}+{2}^{2}{3}^{j}) \\\\  & ={\\sum }_{j=1}^{2}(2\\cdot {3}^{j}+4\\cdot {3}^{j}) \\\\  & ={\\sum }_{j=1}^{2}(6\\cdot {3}^{j})\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we sum over the index $j:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{2}(6\\cdot {3}^{j}) & =(6\\cdot {3}^{1})+(6\\cdot {3}^{2}) \\\\  & =18+54 \\\\  & =72\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364055 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364056 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364055 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364057 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364055 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364058 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364055 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364059 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364055 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364060 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364055 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364055 1077 "selection" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364055 1079 #edb/ref 17592186364058 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364055 1080 #uuid "daa266aa-1db2-5dfb-b2b4-f46ec6d5701a" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364056 1081 "36" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364056 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364056 1084 #uuid "9f59d9ad-6067-5b9d-9845-989efcb883df" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364057 1081 "42" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364057 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364057 1084 #uuid "66c53657-ebb5-5693-9814-81fe8cbc67af" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364058 1081 "72" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364058 