\n\n- ${u}_{1}=\\frac{{v}_{1}}{‖{v}_{1}‖}=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{(-4)^{2}+{1}^{2}+{1}^{2}}}[\\begin{aligned}-4 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}-\\frac{2\\sqrt{2}}{3} \\\\ \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{6} \\\\ \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{6}\\end{aligned}].$\n\n- ${u}_{2}=\\frac{{v}_{2}}{‖{v}_{2}‖}=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{{1}^{2}+{1}^{2}+{3}^{2}}}[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\sqrt{11}}{11} \\\\ \\frac{\\sqrt{11}}{11} \\\\ \\frac{3\\sqrt{11}}{11}\\end{aligned}].$\n\nTherefore, $B={{u}_{1},{u}_{2}}={[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{-2\\sqrt{2}}{3} \\\\ \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{6} \\\\ \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{6}\\end{aligned}],[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\sqrt{11}}{11} \\\\ \\frac{\\sqrt{11}}{11} \\\\ \\frac{3\\sqrt{11}}{11}\\end{aligned}]}$ is an orthonormal basis of $V.$\n\nFinally, $a=\\frac{\\sqrt{11}}{11},$ $b=\\frac{\\sqrt{11}}{11},$ $c=\\frac{3\\sqrt{11}}{11}$ and  \n\n$$\n|a|+|b|+|c|=|\\frac{\\sqrt{11}}{11}|+|\\frac{\\sqrt{11}}{11}|+|\\frac{3\\sqrt{11}}{11}|=\\frac{5\\sqrt{11}}{11}.\n$$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364194 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364195 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364194 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364196 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364194 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364197 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364194 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364198 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364194 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364199 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364194 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364194 1077 "selection" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364194 1079 #edb/ref 17592186364198 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364194 1080 #uuid "80455565-0f85-5273-bf0d-80a5895b80d9" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364195 1081 "\\frac{4\\sqrt{11}}{11}" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364195 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364195 1084 #uuid "12e68ae2-6f20-5f22-9e11-785455