}(A).$\n\nFinally, $a=\\frac{5}{3},$ $b=\\frac{1}{3},$ and  \n\n$$\n\\frac{a}{b}=\\frac{(\\frac{5}{3})}{(\\frac{1}{3})}=5.\n$$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364333 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364334 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364333 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364335 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364333 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364336 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364333 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364337 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364333 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364338 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364333 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364333 1077 "selection" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364333 1079 #edb/ref 17592186364338 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364333 1080 #uuid "48dad23b-c580-5561-a75c-a5c73aafe50d" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364334 1081 "\\frac{3}{5}" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364334 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364334 1084 #uuid "6f024086-bc4f-50c7-879f-d67d9826ebee" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364335 1081 "\\frac{5}{3}" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364335 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364335 1084 #uuid "d74a082c-4c0c-540e-87e1-35c8ac407170" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364336 1081 "\\frac{1}{5}" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364336 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364336 1084 #uuid "070992ba-70a6-5d23-b7bf-86ba4b7d94b5" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364337 1081 "\\frac{5}{7}" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364337 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364337 1084 #uuid "fbc5ae26-bf75-52b0-af4a-500d0d179614" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364338 1081 "5" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364338 1