ith real entries is orthogonally diagonalizable.\n\n- Statement II is false. According to the spectral theorem, the eigenvalues are real but not necessarily distinct. This occurs when the characteristic polynomial has roots whose (algebraic) multiplicity is greater than $1.$\n\n- Statement III is true. Indeed, eigenvectors corresponding to different eigenvalues must be orthogonal.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I and III only.\"" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364444 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364445 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364444 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364446 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364444 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364447 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364444 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364448 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364444 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364449 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364444 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364444 1077 "selection" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364444 1079 #edb/ref 17592186364445 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364444 1080 #uuid "0c5dfe21-2503-5ca5-ba06-5e40538f2c86" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364445 1081 "I and III only" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364445 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364445 1084 #uuid "f6c043df-b951-508f-a8ac-a622bdff16b7" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364446 1081 "I only" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364446 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364446 1084 #uuid "952832fc-ad00-5ff2-84c8-e9a9c82cbf2e" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364447 1081 "III only" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364447 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364447 1084 #uuid "4feb2e46-4dfb-5f30-8616-25de093d73a0" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364448 1081 "I and 