ues and the eigenvalues of a symmetric matrix are real.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II and III only.\"" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364451 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364452 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364451 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364453 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364451 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364454 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364451 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364455 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364451 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364456 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364451 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364451 1077 "selection" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364451 1079 #edb/ref 17592186364453 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364451 1080 #uuid "6d83eaf8-43d8-5306-a69f-c49ea4983f73" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364452 1081 "I, II, and III" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364452 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364452 1084 #uuid "02712a35-380c-5af0-8612-4958a1f8625b" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364453 1081 "II and III only" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364453 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364453 1084 #uuid "08bdc7f8-45b5-5d17-9e52-976b4685ca5e" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364454 1081 "I and III only" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364454 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364454 1084 #uuid "a302555e-ddb4-54c9-8f7c-597f415e28de" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364455 1081 "III only" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364455 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364455 1084 #uuid "f7f68b13-086a-524d-87f0-06b5a99279b6" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364456 1081 "II only" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364456 1083 #