 true] [17592186364532 1074 "First, we complete the squares for the variables ${x}_{1}$ and ${x}_{2}:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3{x}_{1}^{2}-{x}_{2}^{2}-6{x}_{1}+6{x}_{2} & =9 \\\\ 3({x}_{1}^{2}-2{x}_{1})-({x}_{2}^{2}-6{x}_{2}) & =9 \\\\ 3({x}_{1}^{2}-2{x}_{1}+1-1)-({x}_{2}^{2}-6{x}_{2}+9-9) & =9 \\\\ 3({x}_{1}-1)^{2}-3-({x}_{2}-3)^{2}+9 & =9 \\\\ 3({x}_{1}-1)^{2}-({x}_{2}-3)^{2} & =3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, performing the change of variables\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}{y}_{1}={x}_{1}-1, \\\\ {y}_{2}={x}_{2}-3,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwe get the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3({x}_{1}-1)^{2}-({x}_{2}-3)^{2} & =3 \\\\ {y}_{1}^{2}-\\frac{{y}_{2}^{2}}{3} & =1 \\\\ \\frac{{y}_{1}^{2}}{{1}^{2}}-\\frac{{y}_{2}^{2}}{{\\sqrt{3}}^{2}} & =1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nThis represents a hyperbola with semiaxes $1$ and $\\sqrt{3}.$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364533 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364534 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364533 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364535 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364533 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364536 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364533 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364537 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364533 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364538 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364533 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364533 1077 "selection" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364533 1079 #edb/ref 17592186364537 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364533 1080 #uuid "66665b04-8cc0-542f-ad9b-e8d5d6255ced" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364534 1081 "A single point" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364534 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364534 1084 #uuid "9905cbf0-c114-5744-928d-549e3bb50896" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364535 1081 "An ellipse with semiaxes $\\sqrt{2}$ and $\\sqrt{3}$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364535 1083 #edb/re