igned}{A}^{-1} & =[\\begin{aligned}0 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 0\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- Statement III is true. Indeed, for any $m\\times n$ matrix $A,$ we have \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}({A}^{T}A)^{T} & ={A}^{T}({A}^{T})^{T} \\\\  & ={A}^{T}A.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I and III only.\"" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364547 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364548 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364547 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364549 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364547 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364550 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364547 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364551 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364547 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364552 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364547 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364547 1077 "selection" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364547 1079 #edb/ref 17592186364549 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364547 1080 #uuid "df5f5020-3bfe-5ba9-ac48-5edeee6702ce" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364548 1081 "II and III only" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364548 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364548 1084 #uuid "87f9de83-c305-5216-bce3-dd9349ecfed7" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364549 1081 "I and III only" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364549 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364549 1084 #uuid "eaf94fab-b385-52a0-af41-6d00f4a5dbd7" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364550 1081 "I only" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364550 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364550 1084 #uuid "fb5e63ab-43e7-5367-a64a-8da7db506d01" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364551 1081 "I and II only" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364551 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533445 175921860